worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_00.js"
  ceiling 1253
  rationale "Part of the mechanically split browser mirror of the Rust solver: issue #658 divided one oversized worker file by line count, so this shard has no subject of its own. Its ceiling falls as its logic moves into js/wasm-worker. Ceiling moved 1297 to 1299 for the timezone-places seed cache this shard declares and invalidates while shard 09 reads it (entity-grounded hours batch); a duplicated reset line was removed. Ceiling moved 1299 to 1300 for issue #1021 R1021-6: hydrateLinoSeedText ends by learning the program tasks the worker tables lack from data/seed/hello-world-programs.lino (installSeedProgramTasks in formal_ai_worker_program_requests.js), so copy stdin to stdout is a catalogued task in the browser as it is in Rust. Lowered to 1253 for issue #918 (2026-10-08): the bootstrap copies of the brainstorm and persona seeds are gone; both fill from data/seed when the seed loads."
